SOLANO HEAT is a 2D top-down open-world crime game set in the coastal city of Port Solano. You play Mara Voss, a former getaway driver pulled back into the city's underworld across an 8-chapter story — steal cars, build your wanted level from 0 to 5 stars, outrun the police and helicopters that hunt you at wanted level 4 and above, tune in to 3 radio stations, and save your progress as you climb.

## Run it

```sh
mkdir -p out && MAKEFUN_OUTPUT_DIR=out node main.ts
```

Then serve the game locally:

```sh
cd game && python3 -m http.server
```

Open http://localhost:8000 in a desktop browser to play.

